openapi-cli (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Dynamic command generation from OpenAPI specs
  * MCP server protocol implementation
  * WASM runtime and sandbox support
  * OAuth2 and mTLS authentication
  * Starlark DSL engine
  * Daemon mode with socket proxy
  * Cross-platform support

 -- OpenAPI CLI Contributors <info@openapi-cli.io>  $(SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH)
